{"url": "https://x.com/paranoidream/status/2103628312061055006", "id": "2103628312061055006", "text": "This is the first template bot I made, but I haven\u2019t shared it until now!\n\nVirtual Try-On Bot\n\nhttps://x.ai/bot/8Cc1RovyoLulOn9SLY5UR\n\nI started by having it log into my SHEIN account, pull items from boards I created for specific looks, and try them all on me through Grok Imagine. The bot will save images and isolate them as References for accuracy. I planned to continue the flow into buying liked items, but it might work best (and be more universal) paired with your own Shop Bot! \ud83d\udecd\ufe0f\n\n@grok @bot @imagine", "raw_text": {"text": "This is the first template bot I made, but I haven\u2019t shared it until now!\n\nVirtual Try-On Bot\n\nhttps://t.co/guimHSxOpe\n\nI started by having it log into my SHEIN account, pull items from boards I created for specific looks, and try them all on me through Grok Imagine. The bot will save images and isolate them as References for accuracy. I planned to continue the flow into buying liked items, but it might work best (and be more universal) paired with your own Shop Bot! \ud83d\udecd\ufe0f\n\n@grok @bot @imagine", "display_text_range": [0, 496], "facets": [{"type": "url", "indices": [95, 118], "original": "https://t.co/guimHSxOpe", "replacement": "https://x.ai/bot/8Cc1RovyoLulOn9SLY5UR", "display": "x.ai/bot/8Cc1RovyoL\u2026"}, {"type": "media", "indices": [281, 304], "id": "2103628287994191872", "display": "pic.x.com/aslQmaDAIC", "original": "https://t.co/aslQmaDAIC", "replacement": "https://x.com/paranoidream/status/2103628312061055006/video/1"}, {"type": "media", "indices": [281, 304], "id": "2103628287968972800", "display": "pic.x.com/aslQmaDAIC", "original": "https://t.co/aslQmaDAIC", "replacement": "https://x.com/paranoidream/status/2103628312061055006/video/1"}, {"type": "mention", "indices": [476, 481], "original": "grok", "id": "1720665183188922368"}, {"type": "mention", "indices": [482, 486], "o